        <mxCell id="orch" value="&lt;b&gt;Run orchestrator · core-005&lt;/b&gt; · one orchestrator for both lanes: run_id, run states (LOADED → … → PUBLISHED | RUN_ERROR), run-level caps, alerts, per-stage cost. Each lane keeps its own trigger, states and Magentic loop. Lanes never call each other in v1." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="185" width="1460" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
